Provides: va-driver
Description: VA-API driver for the Apple Video Decoder (V4L2 Request API)
 A VA-API driver for stateless V4L2 Request API decoders, from the fork that
 carries the Apple Video Decoder (AVD) support used on Apple Silicon Macs.
 VA-API applications (mpv, Chromium, FFmpeg) decode H.264, HEVC, VP9 and AV1
 on the AVD with it.
 .
 The driver is installed as v4l2_request and as the VA-API driver of the AGX
 render node (asahi, aurora), so libva selects it without configuration. It
 installs no firmware, browser preferences or environment overrides.
